#~ "significativamente a sua precisão ao avaliar jogos com alta expectativa "
#~ "de gols no(a) <strong>%(league_name)s</strong>."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Advanced defensive statistics and Clean Sheets market analysis for the "
#~ "<strong>%(league_name)s</strong>. While attackers win games, defenses win "
